---
title: CMN — gRPC Cross-Service Communication
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant CA as Customer API<br/>Application Service
    participant GC as gRPC Channel<br/>(:50051 TLS HTTP/2)
    participant PG as AdministrationServicePermissionGrpc<br/>[DisableAuditing] [IntegrationService]
    participant MG as AdministrationServiceMailTemplateGrpc<br/>[DisableAuditing] [IntegrationService]
    participant PC as IPermissionChecker<br/>(ABP)
    participant MT as IMailTemplateAppService
    participant UOW as IUnitOfWorkManager

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over CA,PC: Permission Check (IsGrantedPermission)

        CA->>GC: IAdministrationServicePermissionGrpc<br/>.IsGrantedPermissionAsync(userId, permissionKey)
        GC->>PG: PermissionRequest { UserId, PermissionKey }

        PG->>PC: IPermissionChecker.IsGrantedAsync(userId, permissionKey)
        PC-->>PG: bool isGranted

        PG-->>GC: PermissionResponse { IsGranted: true/false }
        GC-->>CA: isGranted

        Note over PG: On any exception:
        PG->>GC: PermissionResponse { IsGranted: false }
        Note over PG: [Silent fail — never throws to caller]
    end

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over CA,PC: Batch Permission Check (IsGrantedMultiplePermissions)

        CA->>GC: IsGrantedMultiplePermissionsAsync(userId, permissionKeys[])
        GC->>PG: MultiplePermissionsRequest { UserId, PermissionKeys[] }

        PG->>PC: IsGrantedAsync per key
        PC-->>PG: results[]

        PG->>PG: allGranted = results.All(r => r)\nallProhibited = results.All(r => !r)\nresult = allGranted OR NOT allProhibited
        PG-->>GC: PermissionResponse { IsGranted }
        GC-->>CA: isGranted
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over CA,MT: Mail Template Send (SendEmail)

        CA->>GC: IAdministrationServiceMailTemplateGrpc<br/>.SendEmailAsync(SendMailTemplateRequest)
        GC->>MG: SendMailTemplateRequest<br/>{ TemplateCode, Recipients[], DataDictionary{} }

        MG->>UOW: IUnitOfWorkManager.Begin()
        MG->>MT: IMailTemplateAppService.SendEmailAsync(...)
        MT-->>MG: sent

        MG-->>GC: SendMailTemplateResponse<br/>{ IsSuccess: true, Data: "success", Error: null }
        GC-->>CA: Response

        Note over MG: On any exception:
        MG->>GC: SendMailTemplateResponse<br/>{ IsSuccess: false, Data: null, Error: ex.Message }
        Note over MG: [Silent fail — error returned in response, not thrown]
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over CA,PG: Test Stub (TestPermission)
        CA->>GC: TestPermissionAsync()
        GC->>PG: TestPermissionRequest { }
        PG-->>GC: PermissionResponse { IsGranted: true }
        Note over PG: Always returns true — diagnostic stub only
    end
